    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d497">

                <pb facs="0676" n="606" xml:id="pg606"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr. Pike.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 52.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1862-04-26"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >April</hi> 26, 1862.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir: Y</hi>our despatch (No. 45) of the 9th instant,
                    containing the copy of a note from Mr. De Sombreff, the Netherlands minister of
                    foreign affairs, upon the subject of the treatment of insurgent piratical
                    vessels, and the concession of the rights of belligerents to the States in
                    insurrection against this government, has been received.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">James S. Pike</hi>, Esq., <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
